  <item>
    <title>从甲骨文到世界模型｜今年爆火的AI新趋势，他三年前开始试水</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae83e9497726cd4675b74c9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae83e9497726cd4675b74c9</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 08:00:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>过去几年里，大语言模型的飞速发展让我们惊叹于它的“博览群书”和“无所不谈”。但能驾驭语言，不等同于理解世界。而</span><strong><span>世界模型</span></strong><span>，就是要赋予人工智能“格物致知”的智慧和“见微知著”的洞见——探索物理世界的规律，推演真实世界的运行，从“观世界”走向“世界观” 。</span><br><br><span>2025年底至2026年，李飞飞、Yann LeCun等一众AI领军者已相继投身世界模型创业。而就在前几天，Google DeepMind发布Genie 4，融合了世界模型和推理模型。事实上，早在三年前，</span><strong><span>西湖大学自主智能实验室AutoLab</span></strong><span>就开始了对世界模型的研究，这次，我们邀请到了实验室负责人于开丞博士。</span><br><br><strong><span>—本期嘉宾—</span></strong><br><strong><span>于开丞 </span></strong><span>西湖世界模型研究中心主任</span><br><strong><span>          </span></strong><span>西湖大学自主智能实验室AutoLab特聘研究员</span><br><strong><span>          </span></strong><span>西湖数智创始人</span><br><br><em><span>本期主持 小野、沈是</span></em><br><br><strong><span>—特别感谢—</span></strong><br><span>西湖大学工学院</span><br><span>西湖大学图书馆</span><br><br><strong><span>—时间轴—</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6">00:06</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a>：开篇</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="111">01:51</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="864">14:24</a>：概念世界模型Concept World Model</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="865">14:25</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1527">25:27</a>：端到端路线的瓶颈</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1528">25:28</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2388">39:48</a>：预测世界的下一刻</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2389">39:49</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3195">53:15</a>：隐空间</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3196">53:16</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3722">1:02:02</a>：Model build the world</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3723">1:02:03</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4483">1:14:43</a>：甲骨文</span><br><br><strong><span>—嘉宾推荐—</span></strong><br><span>黑神话·悟空</span><br><br></p>]]></description>
